    "detailed_description": "Dive into the intricate world of electricity in <i>electrobillion</i>, an educational simulation that unveils the hidden complexity of our power infrastructure. As you manage production, distribution, and consumption, you'll discover the delicate balance between cities, industries, markets, and nature.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simulate real-world power systems.<br></li><li>Balance economic growth with environmental concerns.<br></li><li>Explore the interconnections between electricity and modern life.<br></li><li>Make impactful decisions that shape your virtual world's future.</li></ul><br>Experience the challenges of powering our civilization while learning about sustainable practices in this engaging journey through the electrified landscape of the Anthropocene.",
